@startuml
title Department Operations Dashboard Aggregation
actor HOD
participant "Unified Work Area" as UI
participant "Dashboard API" as API
database PostgreSQL
HOD -> UI: Open department operations
UI -> API: GET dashboard for authorised unit
API -> PostgreSQL: Count active offerings and plans
API -> PostgreSQL: Aggregate session delivery
API -> PostgreSQL: Aggregate readiness risk
API -> PostgreSQL: Compare weighted workload to limits
API -> PostgreSQL: Identify overdue handovers and events
API --> UI: Attention-first dashboard with scoped actions
@enduml
